{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan Abu Dawud","section":{"39":"Battles (Kitab Al-Malahim)"},"section_detail":{"39":{"hadithnumber_first":4291,"hadithnumber_last":4350,"arabicnumber_first":4291,"arabicnumber_last":4350,"name_native":"كتاب الملاحم"}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":4330,"arabicnumber":4330,"text":"حدثنا قتيبة بن سعيد، حدثنا يعقوب، - يعني ابن عبد الرحمن - عن موسى بن عقبة، عن نافع، قال كان ابن عمر يقول والله ما اشك ان المسيح الدجال ابن صياد","grades":[{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Sahih Isnaad Mauquf"},{"name":"Muhammad Muhyi Al-Din Abdul Hamid","grade":"Sahih Isnaad Mauquf"},{"name":"Shuaib Al Arnaut","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Isnaad Sahih"}],"reference":{"book":39,"hadith":40}}]}